{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05100","headline":"初冬从幸汉故青门应制 · 沈佺期","name":"初冬从幸汉故青门应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉王建都邑，渭水对青门。\n朝市俱东逝，坟陵共北原。\n荒凉萧相阙，芜没邵平园。\n全盛今何在，英雄难重论。\n故基仍岳立，遗堞尚云屯。\n当极土功壮，安知人力烦。\n天游戒东首，怀昔驻龙轩。\n何必金汤固，无如道德藩。\n微臣谅多幸，参乘偶殊恩。\n预此陈古事，敢奏兴亡言。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈佺期","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05100.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05100","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}